    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious two bed end of terrace property is located in the popular development of Trimleston. With a large rear garden and off street car parking, this property will be an ideal starter home. There is an array of local amenities and services on its door step including Castlemill and Millfield Shopping centre, Dunnes Stores, shops, eateries, pharmacy, medical centre, schools, cinema and a children's playground.\r\n\r\nBalbriggan train station and town centre, its harbour and sandy beaches are a short stroll away from the subject property. Balbriggan is on the main rail line between Dublin and Belfast, it is serviced by a commuter rail service that provides daily services to and from Dublin city centre and its suburbs.\r\nIt is also very conveniently situated minutes' drive from the M1 motorway providing very easy access to Dublin International Airport, Dublin Port tunnel and the city centre.\r\n\r\nBalbriggan boasts sandy beaches, harbour and the beautiful Argillan Castle with its spectacular park lands and state of the art children’s playground. There are also numerous sports clubs and facilities including golf, Gaelic, football, rowing and rugby to name just a few. Balbriggan is also home to the Irish Institute of Music and Song with its newly constructed Lark Concert Hall."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room 4.7m x 4.2m\r\nBright room with wooden flooring, tv point, feature fire place with an electric stove.\r\n\r\nKitchen 4.6m x 2.8m\r\nFully fitted wall and floor units, wooden floor and tiled border around the units, oven, hob and extractor fan, stainless steel sink, plumbed for a washing machine, fridge/freezer, and dishwasher., Patio door to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nGuest WC 1.7m x 1.5m\r\nWith WC, wash hand basin, vinyl flooring and a tiled splash back.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nWith carpeted flooring, access to the hot press and attic\r\n\r\nBathroom 1.9m x 2.1m\r\nWith vinyl flooring, WC, wash hand basin, and vanity unit, a bath unit with an overhead electric shower, window to the rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 2.6m x 3.8m\r\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring and tv point.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (front) 4.1m x 3.1m\r\nLarge double bedroom with carpeted flooring and built-in wardrobes with window to the front\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\nA wall and fences act as the boundaries to the sunny rear garden. There is a grass area and a Barna shed that is used for storage purposes.\r\nThere is a side entrance to off street car parking for two cars."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Large rear garden with a side entrance.\r\nInsulated Barna shed in garden.\r\nFeature electric stove in the living room.\r\nDesignated car parking to the side of the property\r\nWalking distance to train station and town centre\r\nVery close proximity to Castlemill and Millfield Shopping Centre \r\nMinutes’ drive to the M1 motorway \r\nBuilt in wardrobe in the main bedroom\r\nGas Fired Central Heating \r\nDouble glazed UPVC"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C2"
      }
